  - title: Promotion
    description: Handbills, mailing lists and anyone who will write about you. They
      build Buzz on their own, and every point of Buzz adds a little to the cash
      a gig pays.
    visibleWhen:
      rid: 7579425558579642415
    scope: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ce3b09f5934e5544e97d6ff43cabd5a5, type: 2}
